      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Liberty Blue Estate Agents are delighted to present No. 23 Glencove, an impressive and exceptionally spacious two-bedroom, two-bathroom apartment enjoying a beautiful setting within this established gated riverside development.\r\n\r\nLocated on the second floor with elevator access, this is an apartment that immediately feels generous in scale. Bright, well-proportioned accommodation combined with a wonderful outlook, and a location that offers a rare balance of riverside living, mature woodland and everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nThe main living accommodation is bright and spacious, with plenty of room for both dining and relaxing. From here, doors open onto a large private balcony, creating a natural extension of the living space and a lovely place to sit out and enjoy the surrounding greenery.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen has been completely upgraded in recent years and is finished in a contemporary style, with quartz worktops and matching quartz splashback, creating a beautiful and timeless finish.\r\n\r\nBoth bedrooms are particularly generous. The principal bedroom is a superb space, complemented by its own ensuite and a walk-in wardrobe/dressing area, while the second bedroom offers excellent proportions. A separate main bathroom completes the accommodation.\r\n\r\nThe apartment has also benefited from the installation of a new gas heating system in recent years, adding to the comfort of this B energy rated home.\r\n\r\nGlencove itself has a lovely sense of community, with many apartments owner-occupied and the development is well established. Communal parking is provided, while elevator access makes the second-floor position easily accessible.\r\n\r\nOne of the real attractions of No. 23 is its setting. Glencove is beautifully positioned between the River Suir and mature woodland, giving residents a peaceful environment without sacrificing convenience.\r\n\r\nThe location offers exceptional accessibility, with a host of amenities within easy reach including University Hospital Waterford, Ardkeen Stores, Tesco Ardkeen and Dunmore Road Retail Park. A particularly attractive nearby amenity is the Maypark Trail, where residents can enjoy scenic riverside walks along the River Suir. This beautiful route provides a peaceful setting for walking, running or simply enjoying the outdoors.\r\n\r\nWaterford City Centre is just a short drive away, while the nearby coastal villages of Dunmore East, Passage East and Cheekpoint provide wonderful options for dining, coastal walks and weekend outings.\r\n\r\nCombining space, a high-quality contemporary finish and a superb riverside location, No. 23 Glencove offers an attractive alternative to a traditional home for buyers seeking generous accommodation with the convenience of apartment living.\r\n\r\nWe are advised that the annual service charge is currently in the region of €2700.\r\n\r\n***Liberty Blue Estate Agents and their servants or agents assume no responsibility for and give no guarantees, undertakings or warranties concerning the accuracy, completeness or up-to-date nature of the information and do not accept any liability whatsoever arising from any errors or omissions. The information does not constitute or form part of a contract and cannot be relied upon as a representation of fact. Subject to contract. Please note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings or services. Interested parties must satisfy themselves as to the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs are provided for guidance purposes only.***"
      },
